<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Kurin, Mod Showcase -->
  <Kurin_Scenario.label>魅狐，开拓者</Kurin_Scenario.label>
  <!-- EN:  Kurin is a race born from the genetic engineering of the glitterworld Aolara. Originally a race designed to be the perfect housewife, they created their own republic after gaining sentience.\n\n\n In this republic, the Kurins were able to thrive for hundreds of years under the protection of artificial intelligence and their cunning business deals. However, when the Kurin earned a lot of money from their high-quality goods and unique culture, human forces envied it and tried to take the republic through the war. The Kurin, reduced to a fraction of their original population, fled Aolara on stolen starships.\n\n\n During the Kurin exodus, they were attacked by pirates. Those who weren't lost continued to make interstellar travels to the rim, pushing their ships beyond their original designs. The large convoy of ships soon splintered, and each ship landed on its own rimworld.\n\n\n On this world, the remains of a small yacht piloted by a small group of kurin have crash landed on a new Rimworld. Though other Kurin have established their foothold here, its up to you to stake your own claim in this hostile universe. \n\n\nThis scenario serves as a blanket showcase of all things this mod has to offer. You will start with 4 Kurins, and be allied with the peaceful Kurin Republic. You will still be a target for pirates, hostile outlanders, and the warlike BattleFoxes. You will also start with a collection of strong weapons, giving you a fighting edge in the early game. However, because the Kurins are inherently valuable, difficulty will ramp up quickly. \n\n\n  -->
  <Kurin_Scenario.description>魅狐(Kurin)是诞生于闪耀世界奥罗拉的基因工程种族。她们最初被设计为完美的家庭伴侣，在获得自我意识后，建立了属于自己的共和国。\n\n\n在人工智能的庇护和精明的商业经营下，魅狐共和国繁荣了数百年。然而，当魅狐凭借高品质的商品和独特的文化积累了巨额财富后，人类势力开始心生嫉妒，并试图通过战争夺取这个共和国。人口锐减的魅狐最终驾驶着偷来的星舰，逃离了奥罗拉。\n\n\n在这场大迁徙中，魅狐舰队遭到了海盗袭击。幸存者继续向边缘地区航行，迫使飞船持续超负荷航行。。庞大的船队最终四散分离，每一艘飞船都坠落在不同的边缘世界。\n\n\n如今，一艘载着少数魅狐的小型游艇坠毁在这颗新的边缘世界上。虽然已经有其他魅狐在这里站稳了脚跟，但现在，将由你在这片充满危险的宇宙中开辟属于自己的家园。\n\n\n本剧本旨在展示本模组的大部分内容。你将以4名魅狐开始游戏，并与和平的魅狐共和国保持盟友关系。同时，你仍将面对海盗、敌对的外来者以及好战的战争之狐。开局还会获得一批性能优良的武器，使你在游戏初期占据优势。不过，由于魅狐本身价值较高，游戏难度也会更快提升。</Kurin_Scenario.description>
  <!-- EN:  Kurin is a race born from the genetic engineering of the glitterworld Aolara. Originally a race designed to be the perfect housewife, they created their own republic after gaining sentience.\n\n\n In this republic, the Kurins were able to thrive for hundreds of years under the protection of artificial intelligence and their cunning business deals. However, when the Kurin earned a lot of money from their high-quality goods and unique culture, human forces envied it and tried to take the republic through the war. The Kurin, reduced to a fraction of their original population, fled Aolara on stolen starships.\n\n\n During the Kurin exodus, they were attacked by pirates. Those who weren't lost continued to make interstellar travels to the rim, pushing their ships beyond their original designs. The large convoy of ships soon splintered, and each ship landed on its own rimworld.\n\n\n On this world, the remains of a small yacht piloted by a small group of kurin have crash landed on a new Rimworld. Though other Kurin have established their foothold here, its up to you to stake your own claim in this hostile universe. \n\n\nThis scenario serves as a blanket showcase of all things this mod has to offer. You will start with 4 Kurins, and be allied with the peaceful Kurin Republic. You will still be a target for pirates, hostile outlanders, and the warlike BattleFoxes. You will also start with a collection of strong weapons, giving you a fighting edge in the early game. However, because the Kurins are inherently valuable, difficulty will ramp up quickly. \n\n\n  -->
  <Kurin_Scenario.scenario.description>魅狐(Kurin)是诞生于闪耀世界奥罗拉的基因工程种族。她们最初被设计为完美的家庭伴侣，在获得自我意识后，建立了属于自己的共和国。\n\n\n在人工智能的庇护和精明的商业经营下，魅狐共和国繁荣了数百年。然而，当魅狐凭借高品质的商品和独特的文化积累了巨额财富后，人类势力开始心生嫉妒，并试图通过战争夺取这个共和国。人口锐减的魅狐最终驾驶着偷来的星舰，逃离了奥罗拉。\n\n\n在这场大迁徙中，魅狐舰队遭到了海盗袭击。幸存者继续向边缘地区航行，迫使飞船持续超负荷航行。。庞大的船队最终四散分离，每一艘飞船都坠落在不同的边缘世界。\n\n\n如今，一艘载着少数魅狐的小型游艇坠毁在这颗新的边缘世界上。虽然已经有其他魅狐在这里站稳了脚跟，但现在，将由你在这片充满危险的宇宙中开辟属于自己的家园。\n\n\n本剧本旨在展示本模组的大部分内容。你将以4名魅狐开始游戏，并与和平的魅狐共和国保持盟友关系。同时，你仍将面对海盗、敌对的外来者以及好战的战争之狐。开局还会获得一批性能优良的武器，使你在游戏初期占据优势。不过，由于魅狐本身价值较高，游戏难度也会更快提升。</Kurin_Scenario.scenario.description>
  <!-- EN: Kurin, Mod Showcase -->
  <Kurin_Scenario.scenario.name>魅狐，开拓者</Kurin_Scenario.scenario.name>
  <!-- EN: "Okay, I've put everything down here. Good luck." -->
  <Kurin_Scenario.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>"在这里(星球)把过去的一切都放下吧，祝你好运!"</Kurin_Scenario.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>
  <!-- EN: Pioneers depart with the hope of establishing a new society. -->
  <Kurin_Scenario.scenario.summary>开拓者踏上旅程，希望建立一个新的家园。</Kurin_Scenario.scenario.summary>
  
  <!-- EN: Kurin, Designermate Escapee -->
  <Kurin_ScenarioHard.label>魅狐：逃亡的定制伴侣</Kurin_ScenarioHard.label>
  <!-- EN:  \nYou woke up in a cryptosleep casket within the bowels of a luxury yacht. The onboard AI has informed you that it illegally granted you full sentience over your mind, freeing you from the mind shackles normally placed upon a designermate. Instead of finding out where you are heading, you grabbed the first weapon you saw and fought your way to an escape pod. With no memories of who you are or what you will do, your escape pod crashlands onto the surface of an alien world. \n\nSurvive as an escapee of the original Kurin designermate program. Start with only basic necessities, a gun, and a packaged wedding coat. Because you are a highly-valued designermate, your starting wealth starts higher than normal. Extra difficult. \n     -->
  <Kurin_ScenarioHard.description>\n你在一艘豪华游艇深处的休眠舱中醒来。船载AI告诉你，它非法赋予了你完整的自我意识，使你摆脱了定制伴侣通常受到的精神束缚。你没有继续寻找飞船的目的地，而是抓起眼前的第一把武器，一路杀向逃生舱。你不知道自己是谁，也不知道未来将去往何方，只知道载着你的逃生舱最终坠落在一颗陌生世界的地表。\n\n作为原始魅狐定制伴侣计划的逃脱者生存下去。你开局仅拥有基本生存物资、一把枪以及一件包装好的婚礼礼服。由于你是一位价值极高的定制伴侣，你的初始财富将高于正常水平。\n\n这是一个极具挑战性的剧本。</Kurin_ScenarioHard.description>
  <!-- EN:  \nYou woke up in a cryptosleep casket within the bowels of a luxury yacht. The onboard AI has informed you that it illegally granted you full sentience over your mind, freeing you from the mind shackles normally placed upon a designermate. Instead of finding out where you are heading, you grabbed the first weapon you saw and fought your way to an escape pod. With no memories of who you are or what you will do, your escape pod crashlands onto the surface of an alien world. \n\nSurvive as an escapee of the original Kurin designermate program. Start with only basic necessities, a gun, and a packaged wedding coat. Because you are a highly-valued designermate, your starting wealth starts higher than normal. Extra difficult. \n     -->
  <Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.description>\n你在一艘豪华游艇深处的休眠舱中醒来。船载AI告诉你，它非法赋予了你完整的自我意识，使你摆脱了定制伴侣通常受到的精神束缚。你没有继续寻找飞船的目的地，而是抓起眼前的第一把武器，一路杀向逃生舱。你不知道自己是谁，也不知道未来将去往何方，只知道载着你的逃生舱最终坠落在一颗陌生世界的地表。\n\n作为原始魅狐定制伴侣计划的逃脱者生存下去。你开局仅拥有基本生存物资、一把枪以及一件包装好的婚礼礼服。由于你是一位价值极高的定制伴侣，你的初始财富将高于正常水平。\n\n这是一个极具挑战性的剧本。</Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.description>
  <!-- EN: Kurin, Designermate Escapee -->
  <Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.name>魅狐：逃亡的定制伴侣</Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.name>
  <!-- EN: "I don't know who I am. But I have to survive." -->
  <Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>"我不知道我是谁，但是我必须活下去。"</Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.parts.GameStartDialog.text>
  <!-- EN: A designermate escapee runs from her destiny. -->
  <Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.summary>一位逃离既定命运的定制伴侣。</Kurin_ScenarioHard.scenario.summary>
  
